{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 16, :comments ["<b>And I will bless her.</b> With youthfulness and bodily freshness, after what is written (Genesis 18:12): ״אחרי בלותי היתה לי עדנה״ — 'after I am waxed old shall I have pleasure?' And the blessing of HaShem with an abundance of milk for nursing, after what is written (Genesis 21:7): ״היניקה בנים שרה״ — 'Sarah shall nurse children.' <b>Kings of peoples.</b> This is Jacob and Esau."], :book :genesis, :voice :rabbeinu-bahya, :lang :en, :chapter 17, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:12:50.406715924Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}